<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces continue advancing in Tigray while fighting spreads to the Kenya border, where militia attacks have killed civilians in Moyale and displaced thousands. Ethiopian drones are now operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Drone and artillery strikes have been reported between Ethiopia and Eritrea near Badme, raising fears of a broader border war. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDNLYVFjMzVtckJFOVJ6b2hOaG9VMzFhM3Z0bzdHMkNjYVVwdk1WYVBWc3RUMXFLTmJKNUN2NTJiQmdWYlhpSC1NZmQ0VjJRNElLcTFSTGoyYVN6NE90NHU2Wng0c0hFMk1Qek9FU1E1SDg1dzNnMWJ0RGxTcVBYOExvc3BuNkw2U0paVlZMblFMWF9GTVR2VnBsRlQtaDVjN1otTVcwWU5NMGZYc3ZGUF9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBvR0ZFTTdYWHlfOVJZeWMxUnZDZ3NMZ2tnb1BYeFdSR3FzZ0FsQWZKYmNFYjdQUkhSVE5nMFFpS2RpQXhNRkN6ZnNlZlFPcnJQRi1jZ2hOb2hBVlVVN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNUGVzemFrbHVZeTRzOGZXcnpNZFZ2ZVNwb3JYMDZONUZzblVDMVJBVngwcHZVRlhENUc0U19abmRjX2lpcFNiMktBa0htc1lYT0M4QU9Rd3FJSnNLSV84WnFBTGlFbDRYd2w0RC1PTUlubnA0YTh4ZU56UHdDX0dPdnFvLWdDQmIya2Z2X1h4YVh2MW14dmdIQ3BxalM5VllpUHVyV1BBRWNzRXZIekpEam5QWU04RVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBOWTE1alRLV2lvRVdXdGN2djhudk5HZThrMXhPcDg4eEJIS0dtVHdCNUZzNlNfaDVTSEswaVI5ODFuanBGbU92MTQ2b19fNG94SFQ2NWI4S0hDU2J4NTFsZDFqdDhweERmdkxDU1J3V1R3VGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt